raycontrol — third-party data and programs in this release

ipinfo_lite.mmdb
  IP address data powered by IPinfo (https://ipinfo.io).
  IPinfo Lite, licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
  International License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).
  Shipped unmodified. raycontrol uses it on the node to find the autonomous
  system of a client's address for the optional client summaries (R4-21);
  addresses are not stored.

Данные о сетях — IPinfo Lite (https://ipinfo.io), лицензия CC BY-SA 4.0,
поставляются без изменений.

slipstream-server
  The slipstream server (https://github.com/arngory/slipstream, a fork of
  https://github.com/EndPositive/slipstream; Apache License 2.0), built static
  from the release tag and commit in VERSIONS. Linked into it: picoquic and
  picotls (MIT), OpenSSL 3 (Apache License 2.0) and SPCDNS (GNU LGPL 3.0).
  The complete source of the binary, SPCDNS's included, is the repository at
  that commit; .github/scripts/server-static.sh there builds it again, with
  a changed SPCDNS too. The licence texts are in the repository.

Сервер slipstream — форк arngory/slipstream (Apache 2.0), статическая сборка
по тегу и коммиту из VERSIONS; внутри picoquic и picotls (MIT), OpenSSL 3
(Apache 2.0) и SPCDNS (LGPL 3.0). Полный исходный код, включая SPCDNS, —
репозиторий на этом коммите; .github/scripts/server-static.sh собирает его
заново, в том числе с изменённым SPCDNS.
